sketch-1.bodyMarkdown:
This project combines the Module 1 skills in one program.

You will keep improving the same profile card:

1. store profile values and format them with f-strings;
2. replace stored text with `input()`;
3. clean typed text with `.strip()`;
4. convert a typed age with `int()` and calculate next year's age.

The important project rule is **cumulative continuity**: when one step works, the next step starts from that exact working code. You will modify the existing program instead of starting over.
